---
import { FontAwesomeIcon } from "astro-fontawesome";
import { faCheckCircle, faWrench } from "@fortawesome/free-solid-svg-icons";
---

<section class="py-24 bg-base-100 border-y border-base-300">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 max-w-7xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">
          Committed To Yours Project Success
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-base-content/80 text-lg">
          <p>
            Promatcon will take on the technical responsibilities and give full
            process and mechanical guarantees for equipment packages.
          </p>
          <p>
            For larger deliveries, proMATCON will seek alliances with other
            contractors or fabricators.
          </p>
          <p>
            We have a philosophy that each company shall do the best it can:
            Promatcon In-house work includes project management, technical
            solutions, arrangement drawing and layouts, purchase of valves,
            fittings, instruments and process design (PFDs, P&IDs, data sheets
            etc.).
          </p>
          <p>
            Promatcon will outsource purchasing of piping and steel, detail
            engineering (mechanical calculations, pipe stress, structural
            analyses etc.) and fabrication / assembly as necessary.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-6">
          <div class="card bg-base-200 border border-base-300">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-primary font-bold">
                <FontAwesomeIcon
                  icon={faCheckCircle}
                  class="w-5 h-5 text-accent"
                />
                Process Guarantees
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
                Rigorous simulation and testing to validate output parameters
                before site deployment.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-200 border border-base-300">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-primary font-bold">
                <FontAwesomeIcon icon={faWrench} class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" />
                Mechanical Integrity
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
                Adherence to highest global standards for material selection and
                fabrication quality.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative h-[500px] rounded-box overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
        <img
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuD6Y11XvOGVIfSq5r2AA--jLH7yF7Q_2cjPiOFqPzQNGehL0BK4JOq3-vxHVuk8tjjXcQq-CoKXB9yBRxJTv6wX4Nm5Y6eBvuBC6juIxFZu9Kj-GlWnjwsJlY60xMvwJiQlRL2I03bNHzFOZVRFiJQHX74YhCjjBKR06duh2TkSeG8xN7RftEMpFHWzHCfh9VZAijkQFN3tryvjXi1A7HtZFSaoidkKeERo-AKiKb38aKpFmJCHbJpr"
          alt="Industrial pipes and valves"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/10 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
